[
	{
		// Four recipes rather than one, as vanilla does for rendering fat: each is
		// matched on how many pot slots hold rendered fat. Two portions a lump, so a
		// tallow candle costs less fat than a beeswax one costs wax - and two portions
		// set back into one lump, here and on the item, or melting would make fat.
		//
		// No comments between the recipes: the loader hands every element of this
		// array to the recipe parser, a comment included, and the null that comes
		// back aborts loading every cooking recipe in the game.
